      "english": "Wang Ping really likes Li Guo, and confessed his feelings for her."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "“明天下课，你从校门口往外走，到第五个路口左转，我告诉你我的回答。”",
      "traditional": "“明天下課，你從校門口往外走，到第五個路口左轉，我告訴你我的回答。”",
      "pinyin": "míng tiān xià kè nǐ cóng xiào mén kǒu wǎng wài zǒu dào dì wǔ ge lù kǒu zuǒ zhuǎn wǒ gào su nǐ wǒ de huí dá",
      "english": "Li Guo said to him:"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“Tomorrow after class, walk out from the school entrance, take left at the 5th crossing and I will tell you my answer.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "王平很高兴，第二天一下课，他就跑去了。",
      "traditional": "王平很高興，第二天一下課，他就跑去了。",
      "pinyin": "wáng píng hěn gāo xìng dì èr tiān yí xià kè tā jiù pǎo qù le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "可是，他很难过地回来了。",
      "traditional": "可是，他很難過地回來了。",
      "pinyin": "kě shì tā hěn nán guò de huí lái le",
      "english": "Wang Ping was very happy, and the next day after class he went."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "室友问他结果，他说：“那是一个死胡同。”",
      "traditional": "室友問他結果，他說：“那是一個死胡同。”",
      "pinyin": "shì yǒu wèn tā jié guǒ tā shuō nà shì yí ge sǐ hú tòng",
      "english": "However, he came back looking sad."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "His roommate asked him what happened, and he said: “It was a dead end.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "“死胡同”是走不通的路，也就是“此路不通”的意思。",
      "traditional": "“死胡同”是走不通的路，也就是“此路不通”的意思。",
