    "sentence_translations": [
      "Dead End",
      "",
      "Wang Ping really likes Li Guo, and confessed his feelings for her.",
      "Li Guo said to him:",
      "“Tomorrow after class, walk out from the school entrance, take left at the 5th crossing and I will tell you my answer.”",
      "",
      "Wang Ping was very happy, and the next day after class he went.",
      "However, he came back looking sad.",
      "His roommate asked him what happened, and he said: “It was a dead end.”",
      "",
      "“Dead end” is a road that is obstructed, and also means “this will not work”.",
      "Li Guo used this method to tell Wang Ping: “I don't like you!”"
    ]
